{"url":"https://www.hirschmann.io/","ok":true,"status":200,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-21T13:48:47.458Z","finalUrl":"https://hirschmann.io/","contentType":"text/html; charset=utf-8","body":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"> <head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Florian Hirschmann — Engineer in Munich</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Engineer in Munich. Builds Android Automotive apps shipping in production cars — and roasts espresso on the side.\"><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://hirschmann.io/\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\"><link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"Florian Hirschmann\" href=\"/rss.xml\"><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Florian Hirschmann — Engineer in Munich\"><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Engineer in Munich. Builds Android Automotive apps shipping in production cars — and roasts espresso on the side.\"><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://hirschmann.io/\"><link rel=\"sitemap\" href=\"/sitemap-index.xml\"><script defer src=\"https://analytics.hirschmann.io/script.js\" data-website-id=\"8d517c34-f13e-4d1d-a077-77252e88d319\"></script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_astro/_slug_.DXy1yjyW.css\">\n<style>h2[data-astro-cid-n4qxztk5]{margin:0;font-weight:500}.card-head[data-astro-cid-mspuyifq]{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1rem}.name[data-astro-cid-mspuyifq]{font-weight:600}.card[data-astro-cid-mspuyifq] p[data-astro-cid-mspuyifq]{margin:.375rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem}.plain-list[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:1rem 0 .5rem}.plain-list[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6] li[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]{padding:.45rem 0}.plain-list[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6] li[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]>a[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6],.plain-list[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6] li[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]>span[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]:first-child{font-weight:500;margin-right:.5rem}.subhead[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-faint);margin:1.5rem 0 .25rem}.further-list[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.further-list[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6] li[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]{padding:.35rem 0;font-size:.82rem}.further-list[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6] li[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]>a[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]{font-weight:500;margin-right:.4rem}.further-list[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6] .blurb[data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6]{color:var(--color-muted);margin-right:.5rem}\n</style></head> <body> <main>  <div class=\"hero\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h1 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Florian Hirschmann</h1> <p class=\"muted\" style=\"max-width: 34rem; font-size: 1.05rem;\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>\nEngineer in Munich. I build Android Automotive apps that ship in\n        production cars - and roast espresso on the side.\n</p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#projects\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Projects</a> <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/blog\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5rem;\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Blog</a> </p> <p class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"https://github.com/hirschfl\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>github</a> ·\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/hirschfl\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>linkedin</a> ·\n<a data-user=\"florian\" data-domain=\"hirschmann.io\" href=\"/imprint\">florian&nbsp;[at]&nbsp;hirschmann.io</a> <script type=\"module\">document.querySelectorAll(\"a[data-user][data-domain]\").forEach(t=>{const a=`${t.dataset.user}@${t.dataset.domain}`;t.href=`mailto:${a}`,t.textContent=a});</script> </p> </div> </div> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <section id=\"projects\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class=\"mono-label\" data-astro-cid-n4qxztk5>01 — Projects</h2>  <div style=\"margin-top: 1rem;\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a class=\"card\" href=\"https://automotive-apps.com\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq> <div class=\"card-head\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq> <span class=\"name\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>automotive-apps.com</span> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>2025 — today</span> </div> <p class=\"muted\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>9+ Android Automotive apps shipping in production cars, including BMW. Built solo, end to end: Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, self-hosted backends.</p> <div class=\"tags\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>kotlin · aaos · compose · self-hosted</div> </a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"https://hirschroast.com\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq> <div class=\"card-head\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq> <span class=\"name\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>hirschroast.com</span> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>2023 — today</span> </div> <p class=\"muted\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>I roast specialty coffee: selected origins, fairly sourced, roasted by hand in small batches in Munich.</p> <div class=\"tags\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>specialty-coffee · small-batch · munich</div> </a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"https://autoappstore.com\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq> <div class=\"card-head\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq> <span class=\"name\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>autoappstore.com</span> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>2026</span> </div> <p class=\"muted\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>An app store for Android Automotive OS: developer onboarding, automated quality testing, and controlled app rollouts to specific vehicle fleets and markets.</p> <div class=\"tags\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>aaos · app-store · self-hosted</div> </a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"https://auto-apptest.com\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq> <div class=\"card-head\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq> <span class=\"name\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>auto-apptest.com</span> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>2026</span> </div> <p class=\"muted\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>AI-first, API-first testing for Android Automotive apps. It boots your APK on Cuttlefish-powered AAOS virtual devices for smoke and regression testing before it reaches a vehicle.</p> <div class=\"tags\" data-astro-cid-mspuyifq>aaos · ai · cuttlefish · testing</div> </a>  </div> <p class=\"subhead\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Also shipped</p> <ul class=\"further-list\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"https://espresso.hirschmann.io\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>espresso.hirschmann.io</a> <span class=\"blurb\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>— an espresso machine taken apart, tank to shot</span> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>2026</span> </li><li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"https://coffee.hirschmann.io\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>coffee.hirschmann.io</a> <span class=\"blurb\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>— a coffee bean from cherry to cup</span> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>2026</span> </li><li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"https://improduell.de\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>improduell.de</a> <span class=\"blurb\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>— improv match app with a live applause meter</span> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>2026</span> </li><li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"https://wasgibtsheute.com\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>wasgibtsheute.com</a> <span class=\"blurb\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>— recipe swipe cards for a nutrition counseling practice</span> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>2026</span> </li> </ul> </section> <section id=\"writing\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class=\"mono-label\" data-astro-cid-n4qxztk5>02 — Writing &amp; Talks</h2>  <ul class=\"plain-list\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/how-coffee-roasting-works\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>How coffee roasting works, one bean at a time</a> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Jul 3, 2026</span> </li><li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/how-an-espresso-machine-works\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>How an espresso machine works, taken apart</a> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Jul 3, 2026</span> </li><li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"/blog/aaos-app-testing-with-cuttlefish\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Rendering real Android Automotive devices on a server: Cuttlefish and an AI-first testing portal</a> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Jun 21, 2026</span> </li> <li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"https://blog.automotive-apps.com/posts/2026-04-17-building-aaos-pixel-tablet\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Building AAOS 14 for Google Pixel Tablet — The Complete Guide</a> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>automotive-apps blog</span> </li> <li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_FWhFHNVjK0\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Automotive App Integration</a> <span class=\"faint-mono\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>talk · DroidCon Berlin</span> </li> </ul> <p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size: 0.85rem;\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>\nMore automotive-specific writing lives on the\n<a href=\"https://blog.automotive-apps.com\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>automotive-apps blog</a>.\n</p> </section> <section id=\"beyond\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class=\"mono-label\" data-astro-cid-n4qxztk5>03 — Beyond code</h2>  <p class=\"muted\" style=\"max-width: 36rem;\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>\nI roast espresso under my own label,\n<a href=\"https://hirschroast.com\" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><strong data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Hirsch Roast</strong></a> —\n        up to 300&nbsp;kg of green beans a year. The rest of my free time\n        happens in the mountains: ski touring, climbing, triathlon.\n</p> </section> </div>  </main> <footer> <div class=\"container\"> <nav> <a data-user=\"florian\" data-domain=\"hirschmann.io\" href=\"/imprint\">florian&nbsp;[at]&nbsp;hirschmann.io</a>  <a href=\"https://github.com/hirschfl\">GitHub</a> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/hirschfl\">LinkedIn</a> <a href=\"/blog\">Blog</a> <a href=\"/imprint\">Imprint</a> <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a> </nav> <div>© 2026 Florian Hirschmann</div> </div> </footer> </body></html> ","blocked":false}